== CANON-6/CANON-7: a routine that takes arguments cannot be called by its bare
== name. Found by tools/mutation_fuzz.py (seed 7): the analyzer accepted it
== and only the LLVM backend rejected it.
Module Diagnostics.CallMissingArguments

Show(N Integer) :
    PutLn(N)
;

Main :
    Show
;
